{"2564990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Miracle Karts", "steam_appid": 2564990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever loved anything as much as karting? Miracle Karts™ is a racing RPG with simulation and fantasy elements based around vintage go-karts. Suit up and hit the track and don't let off until racing official Greene waves the checkered flag!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564990/extras/71557370ccfd23bf5c9d6ae1d2b1bbaa.avif?t=1785881512\" width=1024 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devote yourself to mastering the Western Coaxial Union's tarmac and dirt circuits. From Lotti’s glistening shores to Dagset’s rocky coast — a tantalizing spread of events awaits as you ascend to no known heights of karting and limitless speeđ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564990/extras/2cbd68a2f4021b6b973e06cac504bc07.avif?t=1785881512\" width=1018 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As weather and seasons change a true kartwyn adapts. From the frame down to its busy little spark-plug, make your build your own with dozens of unique parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish yourself among your peers and rivals! Choose between league and club events as you forge your path to the top. If you’re dedicated, and lucky, you’ll rise up the ranks from <i>Sorro Series</i> to compete against local legends in the <i>Superkart Nationals</i> and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564990/extras/d4fa6eee17f296d09e9b58042074dac4.avif?t=1785881512\" width=1018 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the track visit <i>Zeke’s Garage</i> for repairs and upgrades, or head down to <i>The Wheeling Fool</i> to meet your competitors, join clubs, or challenge one of the regulars to a duel. That, or just focus on your career. Who needs friends when you can go this fast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564990/extras/71557370ccfd23bf5c9d6ae1d2b1bbaa.avif?t=1785881512\" width=1024 height=82 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever loved anything as much as karting? Miracle Karts™ is a racing RPG with simulation and fantasy elements based around vintage go-karts. Suit up and hit the track and don't let off until racing official Greene waves the checkered flag!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564990/extras/71557370ccfd23bf5c9d6ae1d2b1bbaa.avif?t=1785881512\" width=1024 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devote yourself to mastering the Western Coaxial Union's tarmac and dirt circuits. From Lotti’s glistening shores to Dagset’s rocky coast — a tantalizing spread of events awaits as you ascend to no known heights of karting and limitless speeđ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564990/extras/2cbd68a2f4021b6b973e06cac504bc07.avif?t=1785881512\" width=1018 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As weather and seasons change a true kartwyn adapts. From the frame down to its busy little spark-plug, make your build your own with dozens of unique parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish yourself among your 